@baseUrl = http://localhost:5090
@user = owner

### Swagger UI: {{baseUrl}}/swagger
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Public products; use manage=true + admin identity to include hidden products
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=20

### New category (repeating this name returns 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
X-Development-User: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Hoa tốt nghiệp"}

### Owner-only flower price; reread product version before submitting again
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/stem-rose/flower-price
X-Development-User: {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"price":30000,"expectedVersion":1}

### Save the customer's cart (expectedVersion=0 for its initial empty cart)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart
X-Development-User: customer-a
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"id":"bouquet-rose","quantity":2}],"expectedVersion":0}

### Authoritative quote; prices never come from client cart storage
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{"items":[{"id":"bouquet-rose","quantity":2}],"promotionId":"demo10","deliveryZoneId":"hcm-q1"}

### Owner role management in simulated identities only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users
X-Development-User: {{user}}

### Every successful mutation has an audit entry where applicable
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit?page=1&pageSize=25
X-Development-User: {{user}}
